            </div>

            <hr class="border-slate-200 mb-4" />

            <div class="space-y-3 mb-6 text-sm text-slate-600 bg-brand-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="font-medium text-brand-800">Before you submit, please read:</p>
              <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-none">
                <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500 font-bold">·</span> Your information is used solely for recruitment matching purposes.</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500 font-bold">·</span> Peterson Care Solutions will never sell your data to third parties.</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500 font-bold">·</span> A recruiter will contact you via WhatsApp or email within 3–5 business days.</li>
                <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500 font-bold">·</span> Applying is completely free of charge.</li>
